Package: arabicR
Type: Package
Title: Arabic Text and Right-to-Left Graphics
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Mac OS", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mac@wael.tk")
Description: Helpers for rendering Arabic Unicode text with connected letters,
    right alignment, and suitable fonts. Provides ragg and Cairo graphics
    devices, font checks, grid text, and optional ggplot2 theme support.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: grDevices, grid, utils, systemfonts (>= 1.3.1)
Suggests: ragg (>= 1.4.0), textshaping (>= 1.0.5), ggplot2, ggprism
